	START_NODE -> "enter purchase order details"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_IBG5" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It starts with entering purchase order details. 
Once entering purchase order details occurs, creating a receiving report needs to be done. 
After creating a receiving report, gathering the receiving report should be done. 
When gathering the receiving report is completed, the process is split into 2 parallel branches: checking dates to avoid penalty charges and entering the invoice into the accounts payable account. 
Once checking dates to avoid penalty charges occurs, creating voucher for the documents needs to be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the payment process. It starts with entering the order details.
Once the purchase order details are entered, a receiving report must be created.
The receiving report should be collected after the reporting is created.
When the collecting is completed, the process is divided into 2 parallel branches : checking date to avoid penalty charges and entering invoices into the account payable.
Once the check of dates is to avoid penalties, the creation of a voucher for documents is also necessary.
Now the process is completed.
"
